referent MoonwellPulseOpen
referent MoonwellPulse
referent JournalAction
referent JournalResource
referent JournalPayload
referent JournalResult

capability world-journal-capability

relation moonwell-pulse
  reads {pulse: MoonwellPulse} records {action: JournalAction} at {resource: JournalResource} with {payload: JournalPayload} yielding {result: JournalResult}
  subject pulse
  mode given pulse action resource payload yields result: many
    reactive while MoonwellPulseOpen
    continues linearly
    effect action resource resource payload payload requires world-journal-capability
